# lib/ is NOT ignored: the four dependencies are git SUBMODULES, pinned by commit
# so CI and a fresh clone compile exactly what this machine compiles. Ignoring
# lib/ is what silently left forge-std and openzeppelin-contracts unrecorded —
# the repo built here and nowhere else, which CI (#4) found on its first run.
